      },
      {
        "title": "Word order",
        "title_cz": "Pořadí slov",
        "body": "Question word first. Then the same question shape as before.",
        "body_cz": "Nejdřív tázací slovo. Pak stejný tvar otázky jako v Q & neg.",
        "table": {
          "caption": "shape",
          "headers": [
            "Type",
            "Order",
            "Example"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "with be",
              "Q-word + be + …",
              "Where is the station?"
            ],
            [
              "with do",
              "Q-word + do + I/you/we/they + verb",
              "Where do you live?"
            ],
            [
              "with does",
              "Q-word + does + he/she/it + verb",
              "Where does she work?"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "points": [
          "After does use base verb: work (not works)",
          "Yes/no questions have no who/what… — this unit adds the openers"
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Remember",
        "title_cz": "Pamatuj",
        "points": [
          "who · what · where · when · why · how",
          "Match first: when = time · where = place · who = person…",
          "Question word first · then be or do/does",
          "Chunks: What is your name? · Where are you from? · How are you?"
        ],
        "body_cz": "Nejdřív význam (when=time). Pak otázky. Pořadí: who/what… + be/do/does."
